         <property name="text">
          <string>### %1 Installer

####

This will install %1 for the current user, by default in a local applications folder, but the installation location can be changed.

The application is normally registered as &quot;%1&quot;, but it can also be installed in a &quot;versioned&quot; form parallel to other installations of the application with different versions.

A further possibility is to just unpack the installation directory without registering it in the desktop,</string>
